      "get": {
        "summary": "Get list of shortlinks.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Returns a list of shortlinks.",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ShortlinkRecordList"
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "api_key": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "post": {
        "summary": "Create a new shortlink.",
        "description": "Create a new shortlink. Supports a simple redirect or a redirect with add-ons (scheduledRedirect, clickCountRedirect, webhook, previewLink, qrCode).\n\n**Simple redirect example:**\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"https://api.roo.bz/v1/urls\" \\\n  -H \"X-Api-Key: ******\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"url\": \"https://www.kipanga.com.au/\"\n  }'\n```\n\n**With add-ons example (includes all add-on types):**\n\n> ⚠️ There are two types of scheduled redirects — time-based (`scheduledRedirect`) and click-based (`clickCountRedirect`). If using both, make sure they don't clash and break your expected behaviour.\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"https://api.roo.bz/v1/urls\" \\\n  -H \"X-Api-Key: ******\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"url\": \"https://www.kipanga.com.au/\",\n    \"addOns\": [\n      {\n        \"addOn\": \"clickCountRedirect\",\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"data\": {\n          \"schedule\": [\n            { \"url\": \"https://fourday.ai/\",  \"clickCount\": 3 },\n            { \"url\": \"https://youtube.com/\", \"clickCount\": 5 }\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"addOn\": \"scheduledRedirect\",\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"data\": {\n          \"schedule\": [\n            { \"url\": \"https://fourday.ai/\",  \"timestamp\": 1736477880 },\n            { \"url\": \"https://youtube.com/\", \"timestamp\": 1736478000 }\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"addOn\": \"webhook\",\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"data\": {\n          \"name\": \"Test\",\n          \"endpoint\": \"https://eofhbh0hvdnyiew.m.pipedream.net\",\n          \"method\": \"POST\",\n          \"headers\": {},\n          \"queryString\": {},\n          \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n          \"body\": \"{}\",\n          \"addMetadata\": true\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"addOn\": \"previewLink\",\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"data\": {\n          \"title\": \"test title\",\n          \"description\": \"test description\",\n          \"image\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"addOn\": \"qrCode\",\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"data\": {\n          \"codeColor\": \"#58CB96\",\n          \"backgroundColor\": \"#FFFFFF\",\n          \"qtType\": \"mode_6\",\n          \"scale\": 1,\n          \"logo\": \"\",\n          \"displayRooLogo\": false\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }'\n```\n\nSet `addMetadata` to `false` on the webhook add-on if you don't want extra click data added to the webhook call.\n\nFor `previewLink`, send `image` as a base64 data URI when uploading a new image; when editing without changing the image, send back the `image_url` returned by the server instead.",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "body",
            "name": "shortlink",
            "description": "Shortlink details",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Shortlink"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Shortlink was successfully created.",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ShortlinkCreated"
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "api_key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
